sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor You
  participant H as Hashi
  participant E as Your Ethereum wallet
  participant N as NEAR Intents
  participant B as Your Bitcoin Cash wallet
  participant C as Cauldron
  You->>H: 50 USDC on Ethereum → PUSD
  H->>N: price-only quotes (THORChain too)
  H->>C: price the BCH → PUSD leg
  H-->>You: NEAR Intents → Cauldron: 49.83 PUSD, at least 49.33, $0.28 in fees, ~3 min
  You->>H: Start swap
  H->>N: real quote: a deposit address for this swap
  H->>E: approval 1: send 50 USDC to that address
  E->>N: 50 USDC
  loop every 5 s until it settles
    H->>N: status?
  end
  N->>B: BCH to your plain (q…) address
  You->>H: Swap the BCH into PUSD
  H->>C: build the trade from exactly those coins
  H->>B: approval 2: sign the Cauldron trade
  B-->>H: signed (Hashi broadcasts it through Electrum)
  C-->>B: PUSD to your token (z…) address
